    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n19 hours ago The Dunnellon Tigers lost 3-0 to the Leesburg Yellow Jackets on Tuesday. The Tigers have now taken an 'L' in back-to-back games. Dunnellon took the loss but they managed to make steady progress, increasing their score in every set they played. Once all was said and done, the final score wound up at 25-10, 25-11, 25-16. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
